<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - MEDPARTNERS STARTED.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - MEDPARTNERS STARTED.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dillon, Read &amp; Co Inc said on Wednesday it started coverage of MedPartners Inc with an outperform rating and 12-month price target of $31 per share.</p>
<p>-- Analyst James Lane said in a research note his 1997 earnings estimate was $1.11 per share and his 1998 estimate was $1.38 per share.</p>
<p>-- &quot;MedPartners' rapid growth has been driven by its proficiency for consolidating physician practices and related businesses during the last two years,&quot; Lane said. &quot;We believe that the company's acquisition and development team is likely the most substantial in the practice management industry.&quot;</p>
<p>-- The stock dipped 1/16 to 22-3/8.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
